  <h1 class="article-title">Vehicle Wraps Rotterdam Zuid &mdash; Charlois, Tarwewijk &amp; Maashaven</h1>

  <p class="bluf-answer">
    Vehicle wraps in Rotterdam Zuid from &euro;495 &middot; 5&ndash;7 day lead time &middot; two-year warranty. Specialist in auto-dealer fleet wraps and logistics van graphics for Charlois, Tarwewijk and the Maashaven industrial zone.
  </p>

  <div class="article-meta">
    <span>Updated: May 2026</span>
    <span>Neighbourhood &times; Service</span>
    <span>Rotterdam Zuid</span>
  </div>

  <div class="article-body">

    <p>Rotterdam Zuid is the industrial and port-adjacent south bank of the city, encompassing Charlois, Tarwewijk and the vast Maashaven&ndash;Waalhaven logistics corridor. The district is home to one of the highest concentrations of independent auto dealers, lease companies and last-mile logistics operators in the greater Rotterdam region. A branded van in this environment is not optional &mdash; it is the primary marketing channel for most trades. A vehicle driving between Charlois and the port passes tens of thousands of commuters, port workers and retail visitors daily.</p>

    <p>Vehicle wraps in Zuid must perform in a demanding working environment. Cast vinyl must withstand diesel exhaust, salt spray from nearby port roads and frequent washing. Alfa Reclame specifies only A-brand cast vinyl &mdash; 3M 1080, Avery Supreme Wrapping Film and KPMF K75400 &mdash; for all vehicle work in this zone. We do not use calendered vinyl on vehicles: it lifts at panel edges within 18 months under high-UV outdoor conditions and the daily washing cycles common in fleet operation.</p>

    <h2>What we do in this neighbourhood</h2>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Auto dealer and lease company fleet (Maashaven, Waalhaven)</strong> &mdash; Full colour-change wraps and partial branding wraps for dealer demonstration and lease fleets. We process three to five vehicles per week at our Rotterdam facility. Fleet pricing available from three vehicles with a 10&ndash;15% volume discount.</li>
      <li><strong>Logistics and trades vans (Charlois, Tarwewijk)</strong> &mdash; Door lettering, rear panel graphics and full van wraps for plumbers, electricians, delivery operators and building contractors. We keep pre-cut template stock for popular Transit, Sprinter and Crafter formats to reduce production time.</li>
      <li><strong>Colour-change wraps for private vehicles</strong> &mdash; Satin, gloss and matte colour-change wraps for personal cars registered in Zuid. Particularly popular among enthusiasts near the Maashaven used-car corridor on Maasboulevard.</li>
    </ul>

